### 家族関係の登録
POST http://localhost/api/family-link
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "elder_user_id": 1,
    "family_user_id": 1,
    "relationship": "孫"
}

### 家族関係の取得
GET http://localhost/api/family-link
Accept: application/json

### 家族ユーザー登録
POST http://localhost/api/family-user
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "name": "佐藤花子",
    "firebase_uid": "test_family_uid_002"
}

### 家族ユーザー全件取得
GET http://localhost/api/family-user
Accept: application/json

### ID指定取得
GET http://localhost/api/family-user?id=3
Accept: application/json

### 高齢者ユーザー登録
POST http://localhost/api/elder-user
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "name": "佐藤里子",
    "firebase_uid": "test_elder_uid_002"
}

### 高齢者ユーザー全件取得
GET http://localhost/api/elder-user
Accept: application/json

### ID指定取得
GET http://localhost/api/elder-user?id=1
Accept: application/json

###ゲームマスターデータ取得
GET http://localhost/api/games
Accept: application/json

###ゲームマスターデータid指定取得
GET http://localhost/api/games?id=4
Accept: application/json

### ゲーム登録
POST http://localhost/api/games
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "name": "ゲーム4"
}
